  "definition": "Classification of Water Treatment Systems",
  "effectiveDate": "2017-08-19",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 502) #9410, eff 3-12-09 (formerly Env-Ws 367.09); ss by #12363, eff 8-19-17 (formerly Env-Dw 502.12)",
